<cl=A2A2A2>
Druids are representatives of the most ancient school of magic of the Sphere. The whole life of the Druids
dedicated to the search for harmony with nature, so the druids are alien to combat skills
and high-profile titles. The destructive elements of Fire and Air are not held in high esteem in this
guilds, but Druids devote a lot of time to the magic of Earth and Water. Druids live
in the forest, and comprehended many of its secrets. Sphere forests are quite dangerous, so
Druids perfectly master the art of repelling combat attacks. But
brute force is not their forte, and Druids prefer to attack with magic that,
thanks to the secret knowledge of the Guild, it is strengthened with each new step.
Druids are the only magicians of the Sphere who have comprehended the language and
the magic of beasts. Their efforts were not in vain - now any druid can
to call the beast to help in a difficult moment, and if necessary himself
able to turn into a wolf. Despite such strength, the Druid Guild
She is not belligerent, and prefers to earn the glory of the guild of the skilled
healers and alchemists.
